WEBVTT

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:11.960
On your mark...

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.370
Start!

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.090
Roll camera!

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:16.730
Ta daa!

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:19.870
Happy max!  Brave Max!

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:25.600
It's another episode of the show where 
Brave Max walks around LINK VRAINS!

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.490
Titled "LINK VRAINS, Max Stroll!"

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.980
I'll explore the south area today!

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.540
They're filming that boring show.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.980
Wow.  They're still making episodes?

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.980
This is the south area's warehouse district.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.180
What's that?

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:47.740
It's a garbage can!

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:51.050
That means inside is...

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:55.270
I knew it!  There's garbage inside!

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:56.200
Max-

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.080
This show's garbage.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:03.220
Boss, should we really upload this?

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:05.070
We have no choice!

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:08.360
Because we can't find Playmaker.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:13.700
Even if we upload this, 
no one'll want to view it!

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:15.820
I know that!

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:20.330
It's all his fault!

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:22.960
He said, “I'm Playmaker's soulmate!"

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:27.140
"Stick with me and you'll meet him max!”

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:29.600
I believed him...

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.580
But he's just a Playmaker otaku!

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:34.320
Yeah.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:38.560
It's his fault that our rep 
in the company's horrible!

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:41.180
When he interviews, he 
angers the store owners.

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:44.080
When he duels, he loses to preschoolers.

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:46.820
Do you know how many viewed our last episode?

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:47.650
No.

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:53.200
For Playmaker vs the Knight of 
Hanoi, we had over a million views!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.660
But this time... just 100!

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:01.140
And when I analyzed the account, 20 views 
were the ones we struggled through!

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.250
And Brave Max was 80!

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:06.960
So in the whole world, only 
the three of us watched it!

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:11.100
Boss, please calm down.

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:16.220
We built this editing room by 
borrowing our bonuses in advance.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:19.770
If we get fired, won't we be bankrupt?

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:22.140
You're right!

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:24.570
I must execute my final plan!

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:25.340
Plan?

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:30.060
Find Playmaker and hit a home run!

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:32.190
That's settled!  Let's go!

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:35.740
Boss, we're pulling another all-nighter?

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:58.300
Our lives aren't forever

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:05.090
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:12.410
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:18.980
Sharing hope for the future

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:25.730
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:32.960
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:39.670
I want to share your pain

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.650
Are you sure about this?

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.790
Changing the security without 
your bosses' approval?

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.900
There's no time to get permission.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:19.460
We must build countermeasures 
against the unexpected.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.110
Unexpected?

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.980
We plan to stop Lightning.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:28.020
But we don't know how they'll attack us.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:33.250
They may cause greater damage to 
LINK VRAINS than the Tower of Hanoi.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.090
To LINK VRAINS?

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:38.820
Only you can save LINK VRAINS then.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.660
We're counting on you, Zaizen.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:47.010
If what he said is true, a huge 
calamity will occur in LINK VRAINS.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.180
Calamity?

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:55.420
Ghost Girl sent us footage 
of Earth's final moments.

00:04:56.610 --> 00:05:01.160
In order to collect data, 
we'll now dissect the Ignis.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:02.720
Begin.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.660
What?

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:16.340
Stop!  I have free will!  I'm alive!

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:20.590
That was Earth's final moments...

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:24.940
And they put Earth's power into Go Onizuka.

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:27.280
What a horrible thing to do.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:31.210
So this is our future.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:35.620
What do they think we are?

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:38.860
Onizuka got messed up too.

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:45.170
SOL thinks Ignis and duelists are tools.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:47.130
Yusaku...

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.590
Are you okay, Yusaku?

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.600
You forgot something.

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:58.700
Thanks.

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:04.580
Go Onizuka and Earth aren't your fault.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:08.110
They were duelists with their own ideas.

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:12.190
And that clash led to tragedy.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:18.470
Onizuka abandoned everything 
he had to get stronger.

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:23.120
And Earth fought Onizuka to protect Aqua.

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:28.080
When I stole Onizuka's data, I 
saw some of Earth's memories.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:31.900
The Cyberse World will soon break apart.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.700
The Cyberse World will break apart?

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:35.500
Yes.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:42.210
We must soon choose whether to 
coexist or split from the humans.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.890
Which side will you join?

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:46.650
I can't tell you.

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:50.560
Why?  I'll join the side you choose.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:51.830
That's why.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:55.300
Are humans the Ignis' allies?

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:58.540
You must decide on your own.

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:03.370
Take this.

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:08.170
This is...

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:12.150
Crystal Heart.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:14.690
For which side to join...

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:17.610
Determine with your own eyes.

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:20.490
What's humanity and AI's future?

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:22.630
What's the truth?

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.940
There's no doubt!

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:27.990
I've reached another level!

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:35.910
Earth and Water Ignis, it won't 
be difficult to capture you!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:41.010
Aqua, it seems I must fight the humans!

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:45.910
The hostility between humans 
and AI is increasing.

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:50.100
At this rate, what Lightning and 
Revolver said will come true.

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:51.350
Lightning?

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:54.020
He predicted this?

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:55.160
Yeah.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:58.580
Ai, when we first met Lightning...

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:03.040
What did you two talk about before I arrived?

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:07.010
Back then, he said...

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:10.810
Ai, I want you to help us.

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:15.430
That means humans will be annihilated!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:19.390
Ai, you have the most wisdom among the Ignis.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:22.980
We were born as special beings.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:29.530
Our mission is to maintain the culture 
created on this land, even if Earth is annihilated.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:32.880
Isn't there any way to coexist with humans?

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:36.770
It seems you've become attached to humans.

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:40.740
But do you think that relationship 
will last forever?

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:45.200
Do you absolutely believe 
that humans won't erase you?

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:47.510
By the time you know, it'll be too late.

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:50.410
You'll already be killed.

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:52.930
What a discussion.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:58.140
Then you and Revolver showed up.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:02.810
I already know you have no 
desire to coexist with humans.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:07.160
When I consider what you did to your partner!

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:12.910
We uncovered every person 
related to the Lost Incident.

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:14.490
And we learned...

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:20.150
That an AI caused one victim to be 
involved in a reckless driving accident!

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:22.850
So you investigated that.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:25.190
That was your partner?

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:28.750
An AI caused an accident?

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.690
What for?

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.090
To put it simply...

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:35.550
I didn't need him.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.820
I don't know what you mean!

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:39.930
He was your partner!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:41.340
What you did was-

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:42.600
Exactly!

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:48.400
If you're always with a partner, you 
become devoted to humans - like you.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.590
I don't like that!

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.540
That's what I feel when I look at you, Ai.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:58.320
They have no intention to 
work things out with humans?

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:05.070
Humans may have underestimated what it 
means for AIs to evolve and have free will.

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:11.260
Ignis are immortal and have 
superior intellect than humans.

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:16.740
We both have free will, but they're 
very different from humans.

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:19.600
What are you trying to say, Yusaku?

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:23.760
Since we're far apart, humans fear you.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:28.400
That fear triggered this fight.

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:32.550
It's possible this fight 
can no longer be stopped.

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:34.610
That's enough, Yusaku!

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:37.940
We have to find a way for 
humans and AI to coexist!

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:40.640
You can't lose heart!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.430
Remember what you said?

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.720
But it seems I fought for this to happen now.

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:50.130
If you don't like it, we 
have to change the future.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:54.180
But will the future really change?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.160
The future doesn't change.

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:58.820
You change the future!

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:00.040
By defeating Bohman!

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:02.040
Ai...

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:07.440
Like you said, we have to change the future!

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:12.290
I agree!  Sitting on the 
fence gets us nowhere!

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.720
Takeru, you're showing your true colors.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:17.630
Oops!

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:20.960
You're right.

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:25.560
We have to win this fight 
and change the future.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:28.010
That's the spirit!

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:30.050
But when this fight is over...

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:33.010
You all have to hide.

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:35.910
That's sudden.

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:38.110
I've thought about it for a while.

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:44.730
As long as Ignis and humans are together, 
foolish people will try to use you.

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:49.230
If that happens, you'll get 
dragged into another fight.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:52.570
Go somewhere isolated from the net.

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:54.700
Does such a place exist?

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.360
If it doesn't, build one.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:00.530
Kusanagi and I will help.

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:07.630
But even if we hide, they might 
build a second or third Ignis.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:08.950
Exactly.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:14.690
The fight between humans 
and AI will likely repeat.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:19.630
But at least you won't be dragged into it.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.770
I want you to live.

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:24.970
Take care of the lives that you have.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.150
Life...

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:29.700
We also have life.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:33.670
That's right.  So take care of it.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:36.370
So Flame...

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:39.680
When that time comes, we'll have to part?

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:41.680
Maybe so.

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:44.420
But maybe that's fine.

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:47.670
There are good Ignis, like you.

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:52.930
But it'll be a long time before 
all humans understand that.

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:57.900
Flame, I want you to be safe too.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:12:59.860
Takeru...

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:05.550
I see.  We'll go our separate 
ways again, Yusaku.

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:11.350
Yeah.  This will be our final battle.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.570
1 2 3 4...

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:19.810
Okay, I'm ready!

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:22.460
I hope they arrive soon.

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:27.440
You sure this is okay?  
Leaving him like that?

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:30.590
All his reactions are annoying.

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:32.490
What is it?

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:35.030
Boss!  Behind you!

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:35.600
Behind?

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.740
Playmaker's here!

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:43.680
Let's go!  Don't let him escape!

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:45.850
Boss, what about Brave Max?

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:48.760
Forget him!  Hurry up or you're fired!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.020
Okay!

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.770
Boss, I can't catch up.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.160
He'll escape!

00:13:58.160 --> 00:13:59.490
Don't worry.

00:13:59.490 --> 00:14:03.000
I thought this might happen.  
So I prepared a new weapon!

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:08.000
C'mon!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:16.550
What is this?

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:20.340
I borrowed our next bonuses to get it!

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:22.370
Full speed ahead!

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:23.440
Okay!

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:32.320
Why did you call for us?

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:39.280
What was that?

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:44.370
Some idiot must have illegally 
modified his D-Board.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.940
What did you want to talk about?

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:50.850
Revolver contacted me, 
saying he wants to talk.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:54.700
Revolver?  The Hanoi?

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.280
Yes.

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:01.290
A card?

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:04.490
No, it's too thick.

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:09.650
Why did Revolver contact you?

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:12.170
I don't know.

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:15.090
Maybe he wants to ask us something.

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:19.040
But why would Revolver contact Playmaker?

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:22.940
Because he knows Playmaker's identity.

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:26.710
And your identity too, Soulburner.

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:27.870
What?

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:29.570
Calm down, Soulburner.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.440
Revolver is the leader 
of the Knights of Hanoi.

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:39.030
Since you're a victim of the Lost Incident, 
it's not weird that he knows your identity.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.660
That's true.

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:48.240
Playmaker and I know Revolver's 
identity too, so we're on equal terms.

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.830
Who is he?

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:55.220
Okay okay, slow down.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.990
Why don't you ask him directly?

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:00.850
Is it possible that it's a trap?

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:04.910
Well, I can't say definitely no.

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:09.630
But I don't think he wants 
to fight us right now.

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:12.830
We're safe thanks to him.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:16.960
That program will protect you from attacks.

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:20.790
Once you install it, they can't attack you.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.400
Why give it to us?

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:25.670
We're enemies, right?

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:30.170
The enemy of my enemy is a 
friend... is all I'll say.

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:32.290
Survive this fight.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:36.340
If you survive, then we'll 
settle things between us.

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:39.990
So that was a Knights of Hanoi program.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:43.880
But that doesn't guarantee it's not a trap.

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:45.820
You're so careful.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.580
What do you think?

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:49.720
I'm willing to meet him.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.930
We have a lot of history.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:55.510
Soulburner, what about you?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:01.500
Sheesh!  We almost died a lot today.

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:06.100
Boss, you should've checked how to brake!

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:10.710
If we didn't escape just 
in time, we'd both be dead!

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.720
Shh!  You're too loud!

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:16.310
Look.  It's Playmaker and Soulburner.

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:20.490
And Ghost Girl and a mystery girl.

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:23.190
This smells like a big scoop.

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:24.960
Film this!

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:25.920
Okay!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:28.590
Revolver is late.

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:35.540
What's this?

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:38.010
Someone created a barrier.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:44.880
You're all here.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:47.250
Revolver...

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:50.090
You trapped us?

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:52.150
Don't worry.

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:56.550
This program isolates 
our info from outsiders.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.190
Really?

00:17:58.190 --> 00:17:59.570
There's no doubt.

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:03.040
All transmissions to the 
outside have been cut.

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:05.810
Even Revolver's here!

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:08.440
I can't hear them!

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:12.310
Revolver, why did you gather us here?

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:18.020
It's the only way to get your help.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:22.440
Why do the Knights of Hanoi want our help?

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:25.940
Our goal is to kill the Ignis.

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:30.010
We'll eventually have to fight each other.

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:33.440
But the immediate enemy 
is the Light Ignis's team.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:36.040
On that, are interests are aligned.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:38.340
Well, Aqua?

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.180
He's not deceiving us.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:45.380
You fought the Ignis alone this whole time.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:46.780
So why now?

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:53.620
To prepare for the fight against the 
Ignis, I tried to recruit Blood Shepherd.

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:55.400
Blood Shepherd?

00:18:55.400 --> 00:19:01.870
But Blood Shepherd wouldn't 
accept my way of thinking.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:06.990
So I gave him a hint on how 
to fight the Light Ignis.

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.230
So this is the power of the Hanoi.

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:14.380
The rebel Ignis are powerful.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:19.760
In your current state, you can't 
win against their Link Spells.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:22.580
Use this duel as a lesson.

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:26.950
But Blood Shepherd was defeated.

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:31.190
Then I send Judgment Arrows to the graveyard.

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:32.420
What?

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:35.900
He let go of Judgment Arrows?

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:50.390
All faceup cards in your Spell & Trap 
Zone and Main Monster Zone are destroyed!

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:53.450
What?

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:02.760
Legatus Legionis attacks 
Fortressdrone Beehive!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.890
Blood Shepherd!

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:24.000
Blood Shepherd's dueling was nearly perfect.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:28.440
But the Light Ignis's dueling was superior.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:33.450
Blood Shepherd's fate will also be our fate.

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:39.180
I know they're planning something.

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:45.090
The more time we give them, the 
further we're at a disadvantage.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:49.040
We need to find them as soon as possible.

00:20:50.490 --> 00:20:54.910
So even Revolver is scared 
of Lightning's power.

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:59.340
If that's what you want to think, go ahead.

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:02.190
Work together?  You must be joking!

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:08.620
Did you forget what you did to us?

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:12.360
Where's Mom and Dad?

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:21.830
Your Mom and Dad searched for you every day.

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:26.140
And they were in an accident.

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:31.950
You messed up my life!

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:33.660
I know.

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:35.920
No, you don't!

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:39.270
Let's duel, Revolver.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:42.050
We're ending this here!

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:44.150
Soulburner...

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:46.640
Sorry, but you all stay out of this!

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:48.720
This is my problem!

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:53.470
I'll crush you and get 
revenge for my parents!

00:21:55.700 --> 00:22:00.780
Fine.  Let's duel, Soulburner.

00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:23.360
Trapped in conventionality

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:24.800
Even denials are obvious

00:22:24.800 --> 00:22:25.930
That There This Whichever

00:22:25.930 --> 00:22:27.770
Hey, isn't it true?

00:22:28.100 --> 00:22:29.430
Why is it before you wake up

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:31.000
You build a wall, saying it's impossible

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:32.170
No discussions, no ideals

00:22:36.490 --> 00:22:39.210
Even together, it's not the same

00:22:39.510 --> 00:22:42.280
Break yourself through  go way

00:22:42.480 --> 00:22:45.420
Even if you lose your 
way, keep moving forward

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:48.490
Our desires won't be stopped

00:22:53.860 --> 00:22:57.060
Let your emotions spill

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:03.200
Keep rewriting  only glory

00:23:03.600 --> 00:23:08.610
If we're together

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:12.010
We can seize it

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:41.270
This duel is to settle the past.

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:47.660
But this is the only way to douse 
the raging fire in his heart.

00:23:47.660 --> 00:23:53.450
Burdened by cruel fate, no 
one can blame Soulburner.

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:57.150
His ill will won't subside unless he fights.

00:23:57.150 --> 00:24:01.700
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Past That Cannot Be Quieted

00:24:01.700 --> 00:24:04.110
Into the VRAINS!
